{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Jumpbound",
    "steam_appid": 3448250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/jumpbound_gameplay_framed9sec25fr_loop?t=1755604682\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/118bb504dbb476eb89eb79aa6d2763ba.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, fall, and go again until you can break the loop and escape being Jumpbound.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/bbfc935ebf3b4a100ecb18ab26d3a495.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a mysterious planet, your goal is to find your way out through the ruins of an ancient civilization. Based on the research of your expedition, your last chance is to reach for the top, where the previous inhabitants of the planet left a travel beam open. However, one wrong move might send you tumbling all the way down and return you to the mysterious Beacon that binds you to the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/ef8cc53734921299cc4ad011759bcdc7.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f237dd106415f8bc0bc28490855fce57.poster.avif?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f237dd106415f8bc0bc28490855fce57.webm?t=1755604682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f237dd106415f8bc0bc28490855fce57.mp4?t=1755604682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform sequences of multiple air jumps and dashes, where you have to master the responsive controls and mid-air movement to navigate crazier and crazier jumps. Take leaps of faith, go around corners, adapt as you go, and face your fear of heights as you're constantly thinking mid-air &quot;Can I make it?&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f0d8e49275e7a641e4430f39add9fa8d.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/cecedca31b394078fbb61a7a08c9e03c.poster.avif?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/cecedca31b394078fbb61a7a08c9e03c.webm?t=1755604682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/cecedca31b394078fbb61a7a08c9e03c.mp4?t=1755604682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with 1 jump and build up your skills gate by gate to become the master of air jumps and dashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/b23fcb23bf889b65b195948bbe3ceba7.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/8f4d1962ed4771ff2cc3a7732f85efd7.poster.avif?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/8f4d1962ed4771ff2cc3a7732f85efd7.webm?t=1755604682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/8f4d1962ed4771ff2cc3a7732f85efd7.mp4?t=1755604682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the view and relaxing atmosphere as you find your way up through the mysterious alien structures. The scenery and mood ranges from beautiful sunsets to thunderstorms, dark caves at the mountainside, and towering cities built above clouds, as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/c341b50af1e52773c0b693bb80b08637.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/36187ea5d47c4519c2fd36f540101ef3.poster.avif?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/36187ea5d47c4519c2fd36f540101ef3.webm?t=1755604682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/36187ea5d47c4519c2fd36f540101ef3.mp4?t=1755604682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take the unforgiving challenge for the glory? Or explore the environment at your own pace and build checkpoints as you go? We got you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/05d771c404b11c54813f2298bf02958b.avif?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=378 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging vertical platforming:</strong> Master the responsive controls, precise platforming, and mid-air movement to navigate tricky jumping sequences and leaps of faith.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enduring obstacles</strong>: Go around corners, dive below edges, and watch out for the various dangers in the environment that is trying to pull you down to the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new abilities:</strong>\u00a0Progress unlocks more jumps and dashes, allowing you to solve even crazier jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric world:\u00a0</strong>Explore the remnants of an ancient civilization through breathtaking visuals, relaxing sound design, and progressing mood and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden secrets:</strong> 24+ collectibles and easter eggs hidden so well even the developers can't find them. Secret paths to cut those valuable seconds out of your speedrun time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable difficulty:</strong>\u00a0Choose from the difficulty modes based on your liking. Play with checkpoints or no checkpoints for achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One goal:\u00a0</strong>Reach the top\u2026 But will you make it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/118bb504dbb476eb89eb79aa6d2763ba.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the jumping puzzles of games like Destiny 2, DOOM Eternal, and Guild Wars 2 and the progressing mood and beauty of games like Journey, Jumpbound invites you to a proper challenge that ensures a relaxing experience even in the face of failure. Treat every fall as an opportunity to learn something new and face your fear of heights as you reach for the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/bbfc935ebf3b4a100ecb18ab26d3a495.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/jumpbound_gameplay_framed9sec25fr_loop?t=1755604682\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/118bb504dbb476eb89eb79aa6d2763ba.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, fall, and go again until you can break the loop and escape being Jumpbound.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/bbfc935ebf3b4a100ecb18ab26d3a495.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a mysterious planet, your goal is to find your way out through the ruins of an ancient civilization. Based on the research of your expedition, your last chance is to reach for the top, where the previous inhabitants of the planet left a travel beam open. However, one wrong move might send you tumbling all the way down and return you to the mysterious Beacon that binds you to the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/ef8cc53734921299cc4ad011759bcdc7.webp?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f237dd106415f8bc0bc28490855fce57.poster.avif?t=1755604682\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f237dd106415f8bc0bc28490855fce57.webm?t=1755604682\" typ